[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0010","text":"……已经完全是秋天的感觉了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0020","text":"是啊\n……好快啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0030","text":"是啊\n──啊！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0040","text":"……？\n怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0050","text":"我答应了姐姐要去买东西的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0060","text":"那、那个，不好意思\n我就先告辞了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0070","text":"…………\n我也一起去可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0080","text":"……诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0090","text":"──水和果冻\n我记得家里的存货用完了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500400_02_0100","text":"这、这样啊……\n那就一起去吧……！"}]
